      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "LEKTRA JIMMY (4) rocketed around 410m at this track in 23.04 three back then has been in the money the last two since. Has the ability and expected to go close again. PAW WINKWORTH (5) is a fast beginner but out of character last time when always well back and missed the placings, finishing sixth (25.78) in a Grade 5 at Warrnambool. Form here sound including two wins. Consistent performer from this draw with a win and two minor placings to his credit. Likely to be about the mark. TOUCH OF SIN (1) is yet to miss the placings in an excellent record this track and trip which boasts three wins. Scored by a neck last time (22.10) in a Grade 5 over 390m at Warrnambool. With even luck and a clean start should be around the money. LAURISTON GIRL (7) generally performs well here at this distance.",
